error[SC0203]: a braced initializer is not read yet
   ╭─[ a_braced_initializer_is_refused.c:1:9 ]
   │
 1 │ int x = {1};
   │         ┬  
   │         ╰── only a single expression can initialize a declaration today
───╯
  = note: a braced initializer needs designators and nested lists, which arrive with structs and arrays
